        When no one told them what to look for
      </h1>
      <p class="text-base text-mist mt-6 leading-relaxed max-w-2xl">
        I asked four frontier models, independently, to pick an agent harness they'd want to inhabit. They all picked the same one — and used vocabulary I never gave them.
      </p>
      <p class="text-sm text-mist mt-4">Ari Mendelow &middot; April 2026</p>
    </div>
